        {
          "text": " Ketubor Daudi nediokasilon kokuju moru, koany, kiriamakinos Siba ekejaanakinan loka Mepiboset kaŋes, kopesikinitete asigiria aarei lupetan, kibwokite imugatin akwat aarei, ka aibuŋeta akwatat nuka imusabibun lueokito, ka akwatat nuka araito nuka aiporo, ka eriagi loka emukule loka ebino. ",
