        {
          "text": " Kotema ekabaka Siba atiar, “Inyoin bo apolou kaŋul? “Koboŋok Siba ebe, “Eraas asigiria nuibwanenete lukokal loka ekabaka; ka imugatin ka araito nuka aiporo luenyamete ikatumunak; ka ebino, loemasete luiiloro kamodiŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
