            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema ekabaka atiar, “Ali bo okoku loka ejakaitikon?” Kotema Siba ekabaka atiar, “Koany, iboie ŋesi koYerusalem: naarai ebala ebe, ‘Kenyakakini lolo eoŋ ekek loka Isirael ajakanut naka papaka.’’’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
