            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema ekabaka atiar, “Inyoin bo kimariai eoŋ kayes, yes odwe luka Seruia? Naarai elami, ido naarai abu EJAKAIT kolimok ŋes ebe, ‘Kilam Daudi’; Iŋai bo do etemari ebe, ‘Kanukinyo kiswamaa ijo kwaŋin?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
