            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema Daudi Abisai ka ikekejaanakinak kere atiar, “Koany, emoi okokuka loalomuni kakuanaka akaijar: mam kereka epedori Ebenyamit lo adepar? Kinyeis ŋes, kisiikis ŋes eilam; naarai ecoraki EJAKAIT ŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
