        {
          "text": " Kotema Akitopel Abisalom atiar, “Koloma mama ejaas abusian nuka papakon, nuetasali ŋesi aidar etogo; eirari Isirael kere ebe kila papakon jo: kosodete egogoŋioros akanin nuka ŋul kere luejaas kajo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
